From b92b4b5e03f8d5c3e847f92eeb72a51005f05fdf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 08:19:21 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat: implement WebAuthn device approval with server-verified
 device sessions

Add /api/device/* (status, register/auth options and verify), device session
cookie issued only after approved-credential authentication, shared
requireApprovedDevice check on notes APIs, logout revocation, UI wired to
server device state, and test:device suite. Registration is always pending;
approval is done manually in the Supabase dashboard.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TJ2eg2JEeM4haxuH5S872R
